<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Picking Macro for Apollo Networks GTA V RP.
Part afk macro need to do skill test every 100 picked and do T/here or move every couple minutes
You can use this macro at your own risk.. Risk is getting PERM banned or Warnings (:

REQUIRED FOR USE OF MACRO!!!

(SETTINGS&gt;ADVANCED GRAPCHICS&gt;SCREEN TYPE&gt;WINDOWED)
IF SCREEN TYPE IS NOT CHANGED IT WILL NOT WORK!!!

SCREEN RESOLUTION USED 1904 X 1041</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MiddleDown 1
Delay 40 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 40 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 50 ms
MoveTo 1003 553
Delay 40 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 40 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 40 ms
MiddleUp 1
Delay 13 s
GoWhile 1 98</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>